  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "NEW IN 13.8.0\n\n      A minor release: one public member added, PackOptions.StartCorner, and none removed or renamed. From the upper\n      left, the default, every packing is the same to the bit as before.\n\n      NEW, Packing\n      - PackOptions.StartCorner: SheetPacker fills each sheet from the corner of its usable area given, UpperLeft (the\n        default), UpperRight, LowerLeft or LowerRight; SheetCorner.Center is refused. The first block goes into that\n        corner and the rows run from its side, laid from its edge; a group laid out afresh puts its main view at that\n        corner of its block, and a group kept as drawn is mirrored as one block, its boxes as they stood. The packing is\n        the mirror image of the one from the upper left, so the sheets taken and how full they are do not change: from\n        the lower right, three boxes 100 by 50 on a usable area 267 by 190 put two in the bottom row, the first at the\n        right, and the third above the first. A thousand boxes in 200 groups on A1 pack in about 5 ms, as before.\n\n      Details in CHANGELOG.md.\n\n      Earlier releases: https://github.com/nguyenthanguth/GeometryHelper/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
